### get menus
GET http://localhost:3000/api/menus/

### post new menu
POST http://localhost:3000/api/menus/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoidXNlcl9pZCIsIm5hbWUiOiJuYW1lIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyIiwiZW1haWwiOiJlbWFpbCIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc2NDY3ODQ2MCwiZXhwIjoxNzY0NzY0ODYwfQ.Jg8xI2r2r94mGstp43yazUNZHRTCuLeAgG40LLxMGjo

{
    "id": "0",
    "date" : 1213123,
    "items": [
      {"item" : "item_id1", "amount": 0 },
      {"item" : "item_id2", "amount": 0 }
    ]
}

### get menu by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/menus/0

### update menu by id
